---
title: Strawberry & Blueberry Overnight Oats
servings: 1
tags:
  - breakfast
  - overnight oats
  - make ahead
---

Add @honey{10%g}, @unsweetened coconut drink{100%ml} and @vanilla Greek yoghurt{75%g} to a #jar{} or #container{}, and stir until the honey dissolves. Add @Flahavan's oats{50%g} and @vanilla extract{1/4%tsp}, stir well until no dry oats remain, then top with @frozen strawberries{50%g} and @frozen blueberries{35%g}. Cover and refrigerate for ~soaking{6-10%hours}, ideally overnight.

-- Morning adjustments: oats keep absorbing liquid, so check consistency before eating.
If too thick, stir in @unsweetened coconut drink{15%ml}.
If too tart, drizzle over a little extra @honey{5%g}.
If not creamy enough, top with a spoonful of @vanilla Greek yoghurt{30%g}.